{"id": "EUVD-2026-57823", "enisaUuid": "332b5f58-647c-31a6-b050-09dc6415be8e", "description": "GitPython before 3.1.57 contains an incomplete denylist in the unsafe_git_archive_options guard that omits --add-file and --add-virtual-file options. Attackers can supply these options to Repo.archive() to read arbitrary files from the filesystem and include them in the returned archive.", "datePublished": "2026-08-13T11:28:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-08T15:24:40", "baseScore": 7.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/gitpython-developers/GitPython/security/advisories/GHSA-539m-9xh6-q6rr", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/gitpython-before-arbitrary-file-read-via-repo-archive"], "aliases": ["GHSA-m3x4-5jfw-2mqc", "CVE-2026-73619", "PYSEC-2026-3948"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.41, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "b4692373-541a-362e-9181-0c4d64646271", "product": {"name": "GitPython", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}, "product_version": "0 <3.1.57"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "4e1867c9-2408-301d-8700-f86f2b1541c6", "vendor": {"name": "gitpython-developers"}}], "isExploited": false}